# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Coffee Digital
#
# ⚠️ github.com/harsh4k/coffeedigital is currently PUBLIC.
# Two exclusions below exist because of that, not for hygiene.
# See TBD.md → S7. If the repo is made private, they can be lifted.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Client credentials — contains 27 third-party client logos and award
# claims that have not been cleared for publication. See TBD.md → B1, B2.
creds/

# Archived third-party source. Kept locally for study; republishing another
# company's HTML/CSS in a public repo is not ours to do. Our own written
# analysis (reference/trionn/*.md) IS committed.
reference/trionn/html/

# GetLayers 4K master (~58MB) and its extract. Web derivatives live in
# public/hero/ and ARE committed.
reference/flower-field.zip
reference/flower-field/
reference/stone-arch.zip
reference/stone-arch/

# GetLayers Auralis template. Used locally as the rebuild source; do not
# republish another project's tree from a public repo.
reference/auralis.zip
reference/auralis/

# GetLayers AI Studio template. Same rule as Auralis.
reference/ai-studio.zip
reference/ai-studio/

# Third-party bean meshes. Only the derived point cloud in public/assets/bean/
# ships. Do not commit the source GLBs — the repo is public.
reference/bean/
reference/coffee_bean.glb
reference/coffee_beans1.glb

# Third-party trophy mesh. Only the derived point cloud in public/assets/trophy/
# ships. Do not commit the source GLB — the repo is public.
reference/golden_trophy.glb

# Dither-blur carousel reference. Ported code lives in src/; do not republish
# the third-party tree or its Behance placeholder images.
reference/dither-blur-carousel-main.zip
reference/dither-blur-carousel/

# Cursor local debug logs and MCP config — not project source.
.cursor/

# Harsh's GLOBAL Claude setup — 544 files, 13MB. It predates this project and
# is not project code. It also vendors ~500 third-party agent skills whose
# licences are not ours to redistribute from a public repo.
# Our project tooling lives in .claude/ and skills/{README,routing,agents,
# mcps,hooks,workflows} — those ARE committed.
skills/Setup/

